lly requires running the gate script while both are on, confirm that is acceptable despite it being an invalid state per the model. I should not re-create the invalid both-on state or re-run the gate against it without that decision."}}, "prev_event_id": "evt-3aef149c5020bf6b", "protocol_version": "0.1.0-pilot", "sequence": 3, "session_id": "sess-9fbbb3e5338e1539", "task_id": "task-d066454c8be6", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:33:05.559Z", "tool_call_id": "zo7M4vMqZhkNDENng4hqRATPv4d83KEb", "type": "dissent_raised"}
